Description: A modular Shiny application for exploratory and statistical
    downstream analysis of 16S rRNA amplicon microbiome data stored as
    'phyloseq' objects. It provides sequencing-depth quality control,
    taxonomic composition and heatmaps, alpha and beta diversity,
    multivariable differential abundance with 'MaAsLin2', Dirichlet
    multinomial community typing, and constrained ordination. Interactive
    figures and publication exports are generated from the same plotting
    objects to improve reproducibility.
